<Group labelreference="L7304" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">We are going to initially limit ourselves to the choice <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>, where <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>is meant to be an arbitrary complex number. Also, let us fix the initial data to be <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>. There is hence a simple analytic solution, which will correspond to the Maple mapping <Font style="Maple Input" executable="false">y_sol</Font> below.</Text-field>
</Input>
