<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">plotter1 := (lambda, h, X, choice) -&gt; plot(Sol(lambda, h, X, choice), axes = boxed, title = typeset(cat(Labels[choice], ` with `), z = lambda*h));</Text-field>
