<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">Let us return to our test problem <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>; i.e., <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>. Now, we will denote the error in our numerical solution at the <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYmLUklbXN1cEdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEiaUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUYjNiYtRi82I1EhRidGMkY1RjgvJTFzdXBlcnNjcmlwdHNoaWZ0R1EiMEYnRj1GNS9GOVEnbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYmLUklbXN1cEdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEiaUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUYjNiYtRi82I1EhRidGMkY1RjgvJTFzdXBlcnNjcmlwdHNoaWZ0R1EiMEYnRj1GNS9GOVEnbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation>th step as <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>. If we subtract each element in <Font style="Maple Input" executable="false">_Stencil</Font> <Label label="L7291" view="label"></Label> from each element in <Font style="Maple Input" executable="false">Stencil</Font> <Label label="L7297" view="label"></Label> and make use of the definition of <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYmLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEiRUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUYjNiYtRi82JlEiaUYnRjJGNUY4RjJGNUY4LyUvc3Vic2NyaXB0c2hpZnRHUSIwRictRi82I1EhRidGNS9GOVEnbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYmLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEiRUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUYjNiYtRi82JlEiaUYnRjJGNUY4RjJGNUY4LyUvc3Vic2NyaXB0c2hpZnRHUSIwRictRi82I1EhRidGNS9GOVEnbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation>, we obtain the following.</Text-field>
</Input>
