<Group labelreference="L7272" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">We see that if <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>, the errors will grow exponentially with <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEiaUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnRjIvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEiaUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnRjIvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn</Equation> (or <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>. Hence, we say a stencil is absolutely stable if <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>. (Different authors sometimes employ slightly different definitions; for example, one could define absolute stability by <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>.) Note that even if a stencil is absolutely stable, it does not mean that the errors do not grow as the simulation progresses; the <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> terms will have some bearing on the evolution of the errors. However, in practice, the condition <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> usually implies that the errors do not blow up exponentially as the simulation progresses provided that the true solution itself does not diverge. Now, we plot the regions in the complex <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEiekYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnRjIvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEiekYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnRjIvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn</Equation> plane for which each stencil is stable (i.e., for which <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>).</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
