<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">Hence, we have seen that under the assumption that the true solution is slowly varying compared to the stepsize of our stencil, the error in the numerical solution of <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> will evolve in a manner similar to the error for <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> with <Equation executable="false" style="Text" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> In particular, if a stencil is unstable for the test problem, it will probably be unstable for a similar nonlinear problem.</Text-field>
</Input>
